      "params_digest": "c9d25d6349c9da44",
      "query": "{\"strategic_intent\": \"Read all staged candidate predictions, reasoning documents, forecast documents, and retrieval logs.\", \"summary\": \"I have reviewed the evaluation prompt, schemas, case context, docket snapshot, and realized outcome for scotus/9026000107 (evt-petition-disposition). Now I will read the blinded candidate files (claude-baseline, codex-baseline, gemini-baseline) to analyze their predictions, reasoning, forecast documents, and retrieval logs.\", \"title\": \"Reading Blinded Candidate Predictions",
